---
/**
 * Scroll position indicator. Driven entirely by CSS `animation-timeline:
 * scroll()` — no JS, no scroll listener. Hidden outside @supports, so
 * unsupporting browsers get nothing rather than a stuck full-width bar.
 */
---

<div
  class="scroll-progress fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-50 h-0.5 bg-accent"
  aria-hidden="true"
></div>
